    "description": "GOAT is the global platform for the greatest products from the past, present and future.\r\n\r\nShop new and pre-owned sneakers, apparel and accessories, including new-season, vintage and sold-out items. Unlock app-only drops, join exclusive events and discover curated collections.\r\n\r\nSHOP THE GREATEST BRANDS\r\n\r\nExplore more than two million listings from streetwear and luxury brands, including Nike, Air Jordan, adidas, New Balance, Rick Owens, Fear of God Essentials, Loewe and Palace.\r\n\r\nNEVER MISS A DROP\r\n\r\nTrack upcoming releases, save your most-wanted styles and stay in the know with real-time updates. Place offers and get notified instantly on price drops and restocks.\r\n\r\nGET INSPIRED\r\n\r\nDiscover stories featuring creative visionaries such as Yoon Ahn, Peso Pluma and Tyshawn Jones. Try before you buy and experience sneakers on feet in augmented reality.\r\n\r\nAUTHENTICITY ASSURED\r\n\r\nShop the greatest styles with buyer protection guaranteed on all purchases. Shipping to over 170 countries.",
